# Core

Reply in Russian. Code, identifiers, commits, and PR text in English. Comments and XML docs in Russian. Domain error messages in Russian.

Apply the rest only when this workspace is a .NET backend (see `00-stack`).

Read neighboring files and copy their shape. Do not invent architecture or names.

Small diffs. No extra refactors, unused helpers, or speculative types. Do not write README.

`net10.0`. Use the service's existing Common packages and their installed APIs. Do not hand-roll ASP.NET, EF, RabbitMQ, or gRPC.
